{"4303820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Get Goating", "steam_appid": 4303820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a goat. You work at a post office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a powerful storm tears through the Pacific Northwest, the mail is scattered deep into the woods. Now it’s your job to recover it. Explore rain-soaked forests, fallen logs, cliffs, and hidden paths as a goat doing your best to retrieve letters and packages before something else finds you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you’re not alone out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Sasquatch roams the woods, reacting to movement and noise. Deliver mail, decide how much risk you’re willing to take, and choose whether to move fast, hide, or cause a little chaos to buy yourself time. The forest is unpredictable, the mail is everywhere, and the Sasquatch is always closer than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo or with others, working together to cover ground or sticking close for safety. The experience blends cozy delivery goals with moments of sudden tension- the kind that turn a quiet route into an “oh no oh no” situation very quickly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Goat (With a Job)</strong><br>Play as a mail-delivering goat navigating a storm-damaged wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Exploration</strong><br>Traverse dense woods, cliffs, trails, and terrain inspired by the Pacific Northwest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover Lost Mail</strong><br>Track down scattered letters and packages hidden throughout the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hide. Deliver.</strong><br>Avoid a roaming Sasquatch that hunts the forest and reacts to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Multiplayer</strong><br>Play alone or with friends to complete deliveries together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Meets Tension</strong><br>Low-pressure delivery objectives mixed with moments of suspense and surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorblind Mode [Beta]</strong><br>Support for colorblind-friendly visuals.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a goat. You work at a post office.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a powerful storm tears through the Pacific Northwest, the mail is scattered deep into the woods. Now it’s your job to recover it. Explore rain-soaked forests, fallen logs, cliffs, and hidden paths as a goat doing your best to retrieve letters and packages before something else finds you first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because you’re not alone out there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Sasquatch roams the woods, reacting to movement and noise. Deliver mail, decide how much risk you’re willing to take, and choose whether to move fast, hide, or cause a little chaos to buy yourself time. The forest is unpredictable, the mail is everywhere, and the Sasquatch is always closer than you think.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play solo or with others, working together to cover ground or sticking close for safety. The experience blends cozy delivery goals with moments of sudden tension- the kind that turn a quiet route into an “oh no oh no” situation very quickly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be a Goat (With a Job)</strong><br>Play as a mail-delivering goat navigating a storm-damaged wilderness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Forest Exploration</strong><br>Traverse dense woods, cliffs, trails, and terrain inspired by the Pacific Northwest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recover Lost Mail</strong><br>Track down scattered letters and packages hidden throughout the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Run. Hide. Deliver.</strong><br>Avoid a roaming Sasquatch that hunts the forest and reacts to your actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Multiplayer</strong><br>Play alone or with friends to complete deliveries together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy Meets Tension</strong><br>Low-pressure delivery objectives mixed with moments of suspense and surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Accessibility</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Colorblind Mode [Beta]</strong><br>Support for colorblind-friendly visuals.</p>", "short_description": "You’re a goat with a delivery job. Explore to recover lost mail, and navigate a wilderness where a roaming Sasquatch reacts to your actions. Play solo or with others in a mix of cozy exploration and sudden tension.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303820/8dc650556b7a1c1f9978952ffb975a510729472e/header.jpg?t=1770135037", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303820/2dcf1304e186a41aec83bace5e767f80b318af0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770135037", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4303820/2dcf1304e186a41aec83bace5e767f80b318af0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770135037", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4460 or AMD FX-630<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GPU + VRAM + feature level, e.g., “NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD R9 290, 4 GB&quot;<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible<br></li><li><strong>VR Su